<title>UK: Essen Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Essen Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers DG Bank, HSBC Trinkaus, NordLB and ABN AMRO.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK ESSEN</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    16.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    16.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  **	  REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+27 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER.</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10	  LISTING  DUESSELDORF PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BOBL 121 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
